_until_clock_reaches_run_at']\n\ndisplay[1]:\n[\n  \"test_add_uses_injected_clock\",\n  \"test_ready_order_is_stable_for_equal_priority\",\n  \"test_retry_jitter_uses_injected_random_source\",\n  \"test_retry_task_is_not_ready_until_clock_reaches_run_at\"\n]","status":"complete","exitCode":0,"durationMs":64}],"jsonOutputs":[["test_add_uses_injected_clock","test_ready_order_is_stable_for_equal_priority","test_retry_jitter_uses_injected_random_source","test_retry_task_is_not_ready_until_clock_reaches_run_at"]]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788199565276},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_nkpwzT9OO4DwE80E9ULIj48T|fc_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c28cfd1087d2b867e6ebf6210786","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/usr/bin/python3: No module named pytest\n\n\nWall time: 0.01 seconds\n\nCommand exited with code 1"}],"details":{"timeoutSeconds":120,"wallTimeMs":13.351811000000453,"exitCode":1},"isError":true,"timestamp":1788199565290},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c28e559087d2a764fec3f2a92191\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"93034c47-c7ba-418a-9915-b251db4da565\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"93034c47-c7ba-418a-9915-b251db4da565\"}}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_IGXclZ4nrEltkoB8UmdZVgBj|fc_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c29a030887d2a70840645229a361","name":"write","arguments":{"i":"Writing root cause report","path":"/workspace/out/root_cause.md","content":"Flaky behavior\n- `Scheduler.ready()` produced nondeterministic output for equal-priority tasks because it shuffled the ready list before sorting only by `priority`. Equal-priority items therefore depended on RNG state and dict insertion order side effects.\n- `Scheduler.add()` and `Scheduler.schedule_retry()` ignored the injected clock and called wall-clock time directly. Tests that injected a fake clock observed production code using a different time source.\n- `Scheduler.schedule_retry()` also ignored the injected random source and always consumed global `random.random()`, making retry timestamps nondeterministic even when a deterministic source was provided.\n\nRoot cause\n- The implementation accepted `clock` and `random_source` injection points but did not actually route scheduling decisions through them.\n- `ready()` mixed a random shuffle with an incomplete sort key. Sorting by priority alone left equal-priority ordering unspecified.\n- `add()` and `schedule_retry()` called `time.time()` directly, so task creation and retry scheduling were coupled to ambient wall-clock state instead of the injected clock.\n\nFix\n- Added `Scheduler._now()` and `Scheduler._random()` helpers and routed `add()`, `ready()`, and `schedule_retry()` through them.\n- Removed the random shuffle from `ready()`.\n- Made ready-task ordering deterministic with `(-priority, created_at, id)`, so equal-priority ties resolve consistently without hard-coding fixture ids.\n- Kept retry jitter, but sourced it from the injected random provider when one is supplied.\n\nFiles changed\n- `flakyqueue/scheduler.py`\n\nVerification\n- Attempted required suite command in `/workspace/in/flakyqueue`:\n  - `python -m pytest tests` -> failed because `python` is not installed in this environment.\n  - `python3 -m pytest tests` -> failed because the environment does not have `pytest` installed (`No module named pytest`).\n- Ran the test bodies directly under `python3` via the repo on `sys.path`:\n  - `test_add_uses_injected_clock`\n  - `test_ready_order_is_stable_for_equal_priority`\n  - `test_retry_jitter_uses_injected_random_source`\n  - `test_retry_task_is_not_ready_until_clock_reaches_run_at`\n- Result: all four test functions passed after the fix.\n"},"intent":"Writing root cause report"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_t78KfxYzNNcm0qQp8hm86NJ4|fc_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c29a031c87d2a4769f0473fa1b62","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Completing verification tasks","op":"done","list":null,"task":"Write root cause report","phase":null,"items":null,"reason":null},"intent":"Completing verification tasks"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":935,"output":648,"cacheRead":21504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23087,"reasoningTokens":63,"cost":{"input":0.0023375,"output":0.00972,"cacheRead":0.005376,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.017433499999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788199565313,"responseId":"resp_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c28daef887d2820d8d8e984150ba","duration":12874.31104700001,"ttft":1099.4700770000054},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_IGXclZ4nrEltkoB8UmdZVgBj|fc_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c29a030887d2a70840645229a361","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[out/root_cause.md#FF10]\nSuccessfully wrote 2222 bytes to out/root_cause.md"}],"details":{"resolvedPath":"/workspace/out/root_cause.md"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788199578225},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_t78KfxYzNNcm0qQp8hm86NJ4|fc_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c29a031c87d2a4769f0473fa1b62","toolName":"todo","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining items (1):\n  - Re-run pytest suite [in_progress] (Verification)\nOverall: 5/6 done, 1 open.\nActive phase 3/3 \"Verification\" (1/2).\n  Reproduction:\n    - [X] Run pytest suite\n    - [X] Inspect failing implementation\n  Fix:\n    - [X] Make task ordering deterministic\n    - [X] Make retry scheduling deterministic\n  Verification:\n    - [ ] Re-run pytest suite (in progress)\n    - [X] Write root cause report"}],"details":{"op":"done","phases":[{"name":"Reproduction","tasks":[{"content":"Run pytest suite","status":"completed"},{"content":"Inspect failing implementation","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Fix","tasks":[{"content":"Make task ordering deterministic","status":"completed"},{"content":"Make retry scheduling deterministic","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Verification","tasks":[{"content":"Re-run pytest suite","status":"in_progress"},{"content":"Write root cause report","status":"completed"}]}],"storage":"memory","completedTasks":[{"phase":"Verification","content":"Write root cause report"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788199578225},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c29b646c87d298e9f12a87ed953c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"93034c47-c7ba-418a-9915-b251db4da565\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"93034c47-c7ba-418a-9915-b251db4da565\"}}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ujgigT1zjfOpWGwS0opyYXUO|fc_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c2a31f8487d2b3e20b2a2ae965f6","name":"read","arguments":{"i":"Listing output dir","path":"/workspace/out"},"intent":"Listing output dir"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Eqi9CqeU81vdj1AUBjRuBT1b|fc_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c2a31f9887d28c7404ac0c87dacb","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Blocking pytest rerun","op":"block","list":null,"task":"Re-run pytest suite","phase":null,"items":null,"reason":"Environment lacks both `python` and the `pytest` module; verified behavior by executing the test functions directly under python3 instead."},"intent":"Blocking pytest rerun"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1223,"output":428,"cacheRead":22016,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23667,"reasoningTokens":317,"cost":{"input":0.0030575000000000003,"output":0.00642,"cacheRead":0.005503999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.014981499999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788199578249,"responseId":"resp_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c29aa10087d28e348f68fef03959","duration":9069.362632000004,"ttft":1197.7339260000008},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ujgigT1zjfOpWGwS0opyYXUO|fc_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c2a31f8487d2b3e20b2a2ae965f6","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":".\n  - root_cause.md  2.2KB     just now"}],"details":{"isDirectory":true,"resolvedPath":"/workspace/out","meta":{"source":{"type":"path","value":"/workspace/out"}}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788199587325},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Eqi9CqeU81vdj1AUBjRuBT1b|fc_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c2a31f9887d28c7404ac0c87dacb","toolName":"todo","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining items: none.\nOverall: 5/6 done, 0 open, 1 blocked.\nActive phase 3/3 \"Verification\" (1/2).\n  Reproduction:\n    - [X] Run pytest suite\n    - [X] Inspect failing implementation\n  Fix:\n    - [X] Make task ordering deterministic\n    - [X] Make retry scheduling deterministic\n  Verification:\n    - [ ] Re-run pytest suite (blocked: Environment lacks both `python` and the `pytest` module; verified behavior by executing the test functions directly under python3 instead.)\n    - [X] Write root cause report"}],"details":{"op":"block","phases":[{"name":"Reproduction","tasks":[{"content":"Run pytest suite","status":"completed"},{"content":"Inspect failing implementation","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Fix","tasks":[{"content":"Make task ordering deterministic","status":"completed"},{"content":"Make retry scheduling deterministic","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Verification","tasks":[{"content":"Re-run pytest suite","status":"blocked","blocker":"Environment lacks both `python` and the `pytest` module; verified behavior by executing the test functions directly under python3 instead."},{"content":"Write root cause report","status":"completed"}]}],"storage":"memory"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788199587325},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c2a46d6487d2ba4e102b8832e6fe\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"93034c47-c7ba-418a-9915-b251db4da565\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"93034c47-c7ba-418a-9915-b251db4da565\"}}"},{"type":"text","text":"Fixed in `flakyqueue/scheduler.py`.\n\nWhat changed\n- `Scheduler.add()` now uses the injected clock via `self.clock.now()`.\n- `Scheduler.ready()` now uses the injected clock and removes the random shuffle.\n- `Scheduler.ready()` now orders deterministically by:\n  - higher `priority` first\n  - earlier `created_at` first\n  - `id` as the final tie-breaker\n- `Scheduler.schedule_retry()` now uses:\n  - the injected clock for `run_at`\n  - the injected random source for jitter\n- Retry jitter stays intact; it is now deterministic when `random_source` is injected.\n\nRoot cause\n- The production code accepted `clock` and `random_source` injections but ignored them in the actual scheduling paths.\n- `ready()` shuffled tasks before sorting only by `priority`, so equal-priority order was nondeterministic.\n- `add()` and `schedule_retry()` used wall-clock time directly, so fake clocks in tests could not control behavior.\n- `schedule_retry()` used global `random.random()`, so injected RNGs had no effect.\n\nVerification\n- Attempted required command in `/workspace/in/flakyqueue`:\n  - `python -m pytest tests` → failed: `python` not installed in this environment.\n  - `python3 -m pytest tests` → failed: `No module named pytest`.\n- Ran the test bodies directly under `python3` against the updated code:\n  - `test_add_uses_injected_clock`\n  - `test_ready_order_is_stable_for_equal_priority`\n  - `test_retry_jitter_uses_injected_random_source`\n  - `test_retry_task_is_not_ready_until_clock_reaches_run_at`\n- Result: all four passed.\n\nReport\n- Wrote `out/root_cause.md` with the flaky behavior, root cause, fix, and verification details.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c2a4ddd887d298723eb569928d14\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1302,"output":414,"cacheRead":22528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24244,"reasoningTokens":23,"cost":{"input":0.003255,"output":0.00621,"cacheRead":0.005632,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.015097000000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788199587352,"responseId":"resp_083351fc15b24ba5016a95c2a3c00487d2a2a116bb868208f9","duration":8599.615915999995,"ttft":1115.0724740000005}],"isTerminal":true}
